sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant SDK as JavaScript SDK
    participant API as API Routes
    participant Service as Service Layer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant Pipeline as Event Pipeline
    participant Integration as Integrations

    Note over User,SDK: 1. Survey Display
    User->>SDK: Triggers action
    SDK->>SDK: Check eligibility
    SDK->>API: GET /api/v1/client/surveys
    API->>Cache: Check cache
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>API: Return surveys
    else Cache Miss
        API->>Service: getSurveys()
        Service->>DB: Query surveys
        DB-->>Service: Survey data
        Service->>Cache: Store in cache
        Service-->>API: Return surveys
    end
    API-->>SDK: Eligible surveys
    SDK->>User: Display survey widget

    Note over User,Integration: 2. Response Submission
    User->>SDK: Submits response
    SDK->>API: POST /api/v1/client/responses
    API->>Service: createResponse()
    Service->>DB: Save response
    DB-->>Service: Response saved
    Service->>Cache: Invalidate cache
    Service->>Pipeline: Trigger pipeline
    Service-->>API: Success

    Note over Pipeline,Integration: 3. Integration Processing
    Pipeline->>DB: Get webhooks
    DB-->>Pipeline: Webhook list
    par Parallel Processing
        Pipeline->>Integration: Send to Slack
        Pipeline->>Integration: Send to Notion
        Pipeline->>Integration: Call webhooks
        Pipeline->>Integration: Send emails
    end
    
    API-->>SDK: Response created
    SDK-->>User: Show thank you
